 "يُغْنِى", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/1db9c4b9c7c50dd1249d.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "he/it avails", "bs": "koristi", "tr": "yararlanır", "fr": "il profite", "id": "dia bermanfaat", "ur": "کام آتا ہے", "bn": "সে উপকারে আসে", "fa": "سود می‌برد"}}, {"text": "مِنَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَبِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "93:8", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/6087.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Did He not find thee destitute and enrich (thee)?", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Seni yoksul bulup zengin etmedi mi?", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور تمہیں حاجت مند پایا پھر غنی کردیا", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan Dia mendapatimu sebagai seorang yang kekurangan, lalu Dia memberikan kecukupan.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَوَجَدَكَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "عَآئِلًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَأَغْنَىٰ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/6a0362a354ce69433152.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "pa te je obogatio", "en": "and He made [you] rich", "tr": "böylece seni zengin etti", "fr": "et Il [t']a enrichi", "id": "dan Dia mencukupkan [kamu]", "ur": "پھر اس نے (تمہیں) غنی کر دیا", "bn": "এবং (তোমাকে) অভাবমুক্ত করলেন", "fa": "و بی‌نیاز کرد"}}]}, {"ref": "54:5", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hiya", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/4851.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Effective wisdom; but warnings avail not.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Bunlar üstün bir hikmettir fakat uyarılar fayda vermiyor.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "انتہاء کو پہنچی ہوئی حکمت پھر کیا کام دیں ڈر سنانے والے،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Itulah suatu hikmah yang sempurna maka peringatan-peringatan itu tidak berguna (bagi mereka).", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "حِكْمَةٌۢ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بَٰلِغَةٌ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَمَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تُغْنِ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/b5d9cbc7ecffeca49887.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "koristi", "en": "it avails", "tr": "fayda verir", "fr": "(il) ne sert (à rien)", "id": "ia berguna", "ur": "کام آتی ہے", "bn": "কোনো কাজে আসে", "fa": "سود نمی‌بخشد"}}, {"text": "ٱلنُّذُرُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "يُغْنِى", "count": 10, "first": "10:36", "audio": "audio/1c176ac6df88164558a4.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "indicative"}], "gloss": {"en": "he/it avails", "bs": "koristi", "tr": "yararlanır", "fr": "il profite", "id": "dia bermanfaat", "ur": "کام آتا ہے", "bn": "সে উপকারে আসে", "fa": "سود می‌برد"}}, {"arabic": "أَغْنَىٰ", "count": 9, "first": "7:48", "audio": "audio/b4c64fddf9e967bb3739.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "he/it availed; he/it enriched", "bs": "koristio je; obogatio je", "tr": "yararlandı; zenginleştirdi", "fr": "il a profité ; il a enrichi", "id": "dia telah bermanfaat; dia telah memperkaya", "ur": "کام آیا", "bn": "সে উপকারে এসেছিল; সে সম্পদশালী করেছিল", "fa": "سود برد؛ توانگر کرد"}}, {"arabic": "تُغْنِىَ", "count": 4, "first": "3:10", "audio": "audio/96400f16bc53f98ec830.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hiya", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "subjunctive"}]}, {"arabic": "تُغْنِ", "count": 3, "first": "9:25", "audio": "audio/03aa0ea3d06c5838948b.m4a", "grammar